# MyNotes Notebook
# Version Changelog

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
coming soon
- add /Bild slash command: pick an image file and insert a compressed WebP copy into the notebook
- add /Bildverknüpfung: reference a local image file without copying it
- add /Bild aus URL: embed a web image, loaded only after the user allows external images
- add free canvas images - an inserted image can be detached from its text box and placed anywhere
- images are stored as references only; a render cache keeps large originals from slowing the canvas

